@host = http://localhost:5100

### Реєстрація Ivan
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ivan", "email": "ivan@test.com", "password": "123456" }

### Реєстрація Olena
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Olena", "email": "olena@test.com", "password": "123456" }

### Вхід (токен з відповіді вставити в @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ivan@test.com", "password": "123456" }

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN

### Створити групу
POST {{host}}/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kyiv trip", "memberEmails": ["olena@test.com"] }

### Мої групи
GET {{host}}/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Група
GET {{host}}/api/groups/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Витрата порівну (Ivan id = 1)
POST {{host}}/api/groups/1/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Pizza", "amount": 300, "paidById": 1, "splitType": "Equal" }

### Витрата точними сумами
POST {{host}}/api/groups/1/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Taxi", "amount": 150, "paidById": 1, "splitType": "Exact", "shares": [ { "userId": 1, "amount": 50 }, { "userId": 2, "amount": 100 } ] }

### Всі витрати
GET {{host}}/api/groups/1/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Баланси
GET {{host}}/api/groups/1/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Повернути борг (робити з токеном Olena)
POST {{host}}/api/groups/1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toUserId": 1, "amount": 100 }
